    <worksheet name='NHS staffing has grown by over a third — investment isn&apos;t the missing piece'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#2f95fa' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif' fontsize='16'>5. Is funding and staffing the issue?</run>
